| E_mem regime | E_DNN (pJ) | E_SNN early-exit (pJ) | delta |
|---|--:|--:|--:|
| compute-only (0 pJ) | 48870 | 2402 | 20.3x |
| on-chip SRAM (5 pJ) | 103320 | 32569 | 3.2x |
